{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfxxGpVA7Rkzyw6abmktY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EinEEwHEJdtogJrLAHBzM6","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-srvm-p6c/test/probe/p6c_probe_test.clj","content":"(ns probe.p6c-probe-test\n  (:require [clojure.test :refer [deftest]]\n            [yin.vm :as vm]\n            [yin.vm.values :as values]\n            [yin.vm.ucf.v2-support :as s]\n            [yin.vm.semantic-register.layout-test :as lt]\n            [yin.vm.semantic-register.safepoint-harness-test :as h]))\n(deftest probe\n  (doseq [lane h/lanes]\n    (h/on-lane lane\n               (fn []\n                 (let [m0 (h/machine)\n                       box [1 [(get vm/primitives 'conj)]]\n                       m1 (cond-> (update m0 :free-env assoc 'box box)\n                            (= :semantic-register lane) (update :env assoc 'box box))]\n                   (prn lane :rest (h/error #(vm/value (vm/run (h/load-program m1 (s/app (s/v 'rest) (s/v 'box))))))\n                        (try (vm/value (vm/run (h/load-program m1 (s/app (s/v 'rest) (s/v 'box))))) (catch Exception e (ex-message e))))\n                   (prn lane :tail-capture\n                        (try (let [m (vm/run (h/load-program (h/machine) (h/tail (s/app (s/lam ['box] h/capture) (s/lit 0)))))]\n                               [(vm/halted? m) (values/continuation? (vm/value m))])\n                             (catch Exception e (ex-message e)))))))))\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1320,"cache_read_input_tokens":150357,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1320},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_too